  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Oceanographer's Choice** (1 review): Saxophone was featured prominently in this track [3]\n- **How To Embrace A Swamp Creature** (1 review): The audience sang the choir's part during this song [3]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **How To Embrace A Swamp Creature**: back after 121 archived shows (3442 days); rare: 11 archived performances [6]\n- **Attention All Pickpockets**: rare: 14 archived performances [6]\n- **We Have Seen The Enemy**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [6]\n- **Abandoning My Father Talking Blues**: back after 110 archived shows (3225 days); rare: 3 archived performances [6]\n- **Luna**: back after 41 archived shows (1044 days) [6]\n- **Blood Capsules**: back after 29 archived shows (629 days); rare: 8 archived performances [6]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2018-04-12** (recommended): source not stated; 18 songs; 87 min; rated 5/5 by 4 [1]. Said about its sound: The recording has great quality, allowing the listener to hear everything clearly [4]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Banter- Luna, Banter- No Children, Banter- Unicorn Tolerance, Banter-Shelved [1]\n- The reviewer attended their first ever concert, recalling a great time with a great crowd [5]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2018-04-12**: taped by LMGBTapes; transferred by LMGBTapes [1]",
